    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14681" root="رتج" body-key="r">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِرْتَاجٌ</span></b>  <i>A thing with which a door is closed,</i> or
<i>made fast;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِغْلَاقٌ</span>; (S;) [app. <i>a kind of
latch:</i>] <i>it is affixed behind the door, in the part
next to the lock.</i> (Ibn-'Abbád, TA in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عربض</span>.)

